  "projects-individual": {
    "title": "Individual projects & ideas",
    "kicker": "08 / PROJECTS",
    "subtitle": "Software, prototypes and ideas I am exploring and developing.",
    "html": "\n<article class=\"project-detail feature-project\"><div class=\"project-illustration shot-illustration\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"cert-open\" data-full=\"assets/studynest/dashboard.jpg\" aria-label=\"View the StudyNest dashboard full size\"><img src=\"assets/studynest/thumbs/dashboard.jpg\" alt=\"StudyNest dashboard on my account\"></button></div><div class=\"project-description\"><div class=\"project-meta\"><span>01 / SOFTWARE</span><span class=\"status-tag status-progress\">In development</span></div><h2>StudyNest</h2><p class=\"project-deck\">A study-planning web app for students, built with Akshay Chakraborty.</p><p>StudyNest helps students organise subjects, topics, tasks and revision progress in one place. Students have their own accounts, choose their AS subjects, track progress topic by topic and plan their study time. I came up with most of the features and designed the database structure; Akshay helped me implement them.</p><div class=\"tag-row\"><span>NODE.JS</span><span>JAVASCRIPT</span><span>HTML / CSS</span><span>SQLITE</span><span>DATABASE DESIGN</span></div><div class=\"reflect-grid\"><div><span>MY ROLE</span><p>Feature ideas, database design (how accounts, subjects, topics and progress link together) and most of the build. Akshay worked with me on implementation.</p></div><div><span>WHAT I LEARNED</span><p>How to design data before writing code, how a Node.js back end talks to a front end, and how to split work with a co-developer.</p></div><div><span>LOOKING BACK</span><p>Planning the database first saved us from rewriting features later. Next I want to test it with real students and use their feedback to decide what to build next.</p></div></div></div></article>\n<div class=\"card-grid two\"><article class=\"info-card\"><span class=\"small-label\">NEXT PROJECT</span><h3>Web project with Mr. Job</h3><p>A web-development project with my IT teacher, Mr. Job, is confirmed. We are still choosing the problem it will solve.</p><span class=\"status-tag status-progress\">Planned</span></article></div>\n<div class=\"section-head spaced\" id=\"studynest-screens\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">STUDYNEST · MY OWN ACCOUNT</p><h2>How I actually use it.</h2></div><p class=\"section-aside\">Screenshots from my own StudyNest account, October 2026. Select one to see it full size.</p></div><div class=\"cert-grid cert-grid-big\"><figure class=\"cert photo-card shot-card\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"cert-open\" data-full=\"assets/studynest/dashboard.jpg\" aria-label=\"View screenshot: Dashboard\"><img src=\"assets/studynest/thumbs/dashboard.jpg\" alt=\"StudyNest screenshot: Dashboard\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Oct 2026</span><strong>Dashboard</strong><p>Syllabus progress, coverage by subject, a countdown to the first exam, this week’s priorities and today’s study blocks.</p></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"cert photo-card shot-card\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"cert-open\" data-full=\"assets/studynest/study-timetable.jpg\" aria-label=\"View screenshot: Study timetable\"><img src=\"assets/studynest/thumbs/study-timetable.jpg\" alt=\"StudyNest screenshot: Study timetable\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Oct 2026</span><strong>Study timetable</strong><p>My week of study blocks outside school, with hours per subject. StudyNest plans blocks around the ones I add myself.</p></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"cert photo-card shot-card\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"cert-open\" data-full=\"assets/studynest/weekly-plan.jpg\" aria-label=\"View screenshot: Weekly plan\"><img src=\"assets/studynest/thumbs/weekly-plan.jpg\" alt=\"StudyNest screenshot: Weekly plan\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Oct 2026</span><strong>Weekly plan</strong><p>Week 5 of 10: topics and past papers per subject, and a warning when I fall behind the content plan.</p></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"cert photo-card shot-card\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"cert-open\" data-full=\"assets/studynest/goals-imo-camp.jpg\" aria-label=\"View screenshot: Personal goals\"><img src=\"assets/studynest/thumbs/goals-imo-camp.jpg\" alt=\"StudyNest screenshot: Personal goals\" loading=\"lazy\"></button><figcaption><span>Oct 2026</span><strong>Personal goals</strong><p>My IMO camp preparation as a goal: eight weeks of topics, fitted into the free time left after school study.</p></figcaption></figure></div>",
    "description": "Software, prototypes and ideas I am exploring and developing."
  },
